#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'EOF'
Knowledge Hub Interactive Lab
Redis: Cache TTL and Stale Data

Scenario
  The catalog origin now says item 42 costs price=12.
  Redis still contains price=10 and the key never expires.

Goal
  Repair catalog:item:42 so:
    - value is exactly price=12
    - TTL is greater than 0 and no more than 300 seconds

Start here
  status
  docker exec kh-lab-redis redis-cli GET catalog:item:42
  docker exec kh-lab-redis redis-cli TTL catalog:item:42

Useful Redis commands
  docker exec kh-lab-redis redis-cli SET ...
  docker exec kh-lab-redis redis-cli EXPIRE ...
  docker exec kh-lab-redis redis-cli TTL ...

Lab commands
  help    show this assignment again
  status  show the cached value and TTL
  check   validate value and expiration policy
  hint    reveal progressive help
  reset   restore the stale non-expiring cache entry

When finished, run: check
EOF
